# Proguard / R8 rules for ExpenseManager

# Room Database Entities & DAOs
-keep class com.example.expensemanager.data.local.entity.** { *; }
-keep class com.example.expensemanager.data.local.dao.** { *; }

# Retrofit & Gson Models
-keep class com.example.expensemanager.model.** { *; }
-keepattributes *Annotation*,Signature,InnerClasses,EnclosingMethod

# OkHttp & Retrofit
-dontwarn okhttp3.**
-dontwarn okio.**
-dontwarn retrofit2.**
-keep class retrofit2.** { *; }

# Firebase Auth
-keep class com.google.firebase.** { *; }
-dontwarn com.google.firebase.**
